/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (Through keynote addresses, technical sessions, panel discussions, industry forums, and networking opportunities, ICATS 2026 will facilitate meaningful knowledge exchange and foster partnerships among academia, industry, government, and civil society. The conference aspires to contribute to the development of innovative, inclusive, and sustainable solutions that advance economic prosperity while addressing global environmental and social challenges.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
